sólo Tú Señor,
sólo Tú Altísimo Jesucristo,
con el Santo Espíritu
en la gloria de Dios Padre.
Amén, amén, amén.','','Mim','gloria',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'betaniamusic.blogspot.com','2026-09-15 10:27:22','[{"tipo": "acordes", "acordes": [{"acorde": "Mim", "posicion": 0}], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": "Mim"}, {"tipo": "vacía", "acordes": [], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": ""}, {"tipo": "acordes", "acordes": [{"acorde": "Si7", "posicion": 0}], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": "Si7"}, {"tipo": "vacía", "acordes": [], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": ""}, {"tipo": "acordes", "acordes": [{"acorde": "Mim", "posicion": 0}], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": "Mim"}, {"tipo": "vacía", "acordes": [], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": ""}, {"tipo": "letra", "acordes": [], "letra": "GLORIA, GLORIA, A DIOS EN EL CIELO", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": ""}, {"tipo": "vacía", "acordes": [], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": ""}, {"tipo": "acordes", "acordes": [{"acorde": "Sol", "posicion": 0}], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": "Sol"}, {"tipo": "vacía", "acordes": [], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": ""}, {"tipo": "acordes", "acordes": [{"acorde": "Re", "posicion": 0}], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": "Re"}, {"tipo": "vacía", "acordes": [], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": ""}, {"tipo": "acordes", "acordes": [{"acorde": "Do", "posicion": 0}], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": "Do"}, {"tipo": "vacía", "acordes": [], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": ""}, {"tipo": "acordes", "acordes": [{"acorde": "Re", "posicion": 0}], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": "Re"}, {"tipo": "vacía", "acordes": [], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": ""}, {"tipo": "acordes", "acordes": [{"acorde": "Mim", "posicion": 0}], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": "Mim"}, {"tipo": "vacía", "acordes": [], "letra": "", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": ""}, {"tipo": "letra", "acordes": [], "letra": "Y EN LA TIERRA A LOS HOMBRES PAZ (Bis)", "texto": "", "acordes_raw": ""}, {"tipo": "vacía", "acordes":