<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes"><span class="acorde">Do</span>                 <span class="acorde">Fa</span>         <span class="acorde">Do</span>    <span class="acorde">Fa</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">Esto que te doy es vino y pan señor.  </div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">            <span class="acorde">Do</span>           <span class="acorde">Sol</span>    <span class="acorde">Fa</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">Esto que te doy es mi trabajo.    </div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">          <span class="acorde">Sol</span>             <span class="acorde">Do</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">Es mi corazón, es mi alma,  </div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">      <span class="acorde">Mim</span>     <span class="acorde">Lam</span>       <span class="acorde">Rem</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">es mi cuerpo y mi razón,   </div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">            <span class="acorde">Sol</span>       <span class="acorde">Do</span>  <span class="acorde">Sol7</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">el esfuerzo de mi caminar...  </div>
</div>
<div class="linea-vacia"></div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes"><span class="acorde">Do</span>                 <span class="acorde">Fa</span>      <span class="acorde">Do</span>    <span class="acorde">Fa</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">Esto que te doy mi vida es señor.  </div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">       <span class="acorde">Do</span>                <span class="acorde">Sol</span>    <span class="acorde">Fa</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">es mi amor también es mi dolor.   </div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">           <span class="acorde">Sol</span>              <span class="acorde">Do</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">Es la ilusión de mis sueños,  </div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">      <span class="acorde">Mim</span>        <span class="acorde">Lam</span>          <span class="acorde">Rem</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">es mi gozo y mi llorar,          </div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">            <span class="acorde">Sol</span>       <span class="acorde">Do</span>  <span class="acorde">Sol7</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">es mi canto y mi oración.     </div>
</div>
<div class="linea-vacia"></div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes"><span class="acorde">Do</span> <span class="acorde">Mim</span>  <span class="acorde">Lam</span>   <span class="acorde">Fa</span>          <span class="acorde">Sol</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra"><strong>TOMA MI VIDA, PONLA EN TU CORAZÓN.</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes"><span class="acorde">Do</span> <span class="acorde">Mim</span>  <span class="acorde">Lam</span>  <span class="acorde">Fa</span>     <span class="acorde">Sol</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra"><strong>DAME TU MANO Y LLÉVAME.</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes"><span class="acorde">Fa</span>       <span class="acorde">Sol</span>            <span class="acorde">Do</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra"><strong>CAMBIA MI PAN EN TU CARNE </strong></div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">    <span class="acorde">Mim</span>   <span class="acorde">Lam</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra"><strong>Y MI VINO EN TU SANGRE</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">   <span class="acorde">Rem</span>     <span class="acorde">Sol</span>     <span class="acorde">Do</span>  <span class="acorde">Do7</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra"><strong>Y A MI SEÑOR RENUÉVAME,   </strong></div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes"><span class="acorde">Fa</span>    <span class="acorde">Sol</span>     <span class="acorde">Do</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra"><strong>LÍMPIAME Y SÁLVAME</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="linea-vacia"></div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes"><span class="acorde">Do</span>                 <span class="acorde">Fa</span>      <span class="acorde">Do</span>    <span class="acorde">Fa</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">Esto te lo doy, no solo, mi Señor, </div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">     <span class="acorde">Do</span>                <span class="acorde">Sol</span>     <span class="acorde">Fa</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">esta voz también es mi hermano.  </div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">         <span class="acorde">Sol</span>                  <span class="acorde">Do</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">Es la unión, la paz y el orden, </div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">     <span class="acorde">Mim</span>     <span class="acorde">Lam</span>          <span class="acorde">Rem</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">la armonía y felicidad,      </div>
</div>
<div class="bloque-acordes-letra">
  <div class="linea-acordes">            <span class="acorde">Sol</span>      <span class="acorde">Do</span>  <span class="acorde">Sol7</span></div>
  <div class="linea-letra">es un canto en comunidad.    </div>
</div>
